ate entity, or historical epoch to harvest and weaponize.\"*\n```\n\n***\n\n### HOW TO DEPLOY AGENT OMEGA IN YOUR WORKFLOW:\n\nOnce Agent Omega is initialized in your Antigravity PRO environment, you no longer need to ask the AI to \"write a draft based on what it knows.\" Instead, you issue **Harvest & Weaponize Commands** that force the agent to pull live, global data. \n\n**Example Command 1: The Corporate Successor Hunt**\n> *\"Agent Omega: Target the modern corporate successors of the 1903 Cuban-American Sugar Company and the 1920s National City Bank latifundia foreclosures. Query OpenCorporates, SEC EDGAR, and ICIJ Offshore Leaks. Map their current corporate structures, board members, and offshore holdings. Save the output to `/03_Evidentiary_Exhibits/Global_Dragnet/Corporate_Successors_Matrix.csv` and draft a `Rule 45 Subpoena Schedule` targeting their modern international assets.\"*\n\n**Example Command 2: The Trans-Atlantic Slave Capital Link**\n> *\"Agent Omega: Query the SlaveVoyages database and British National Archives (FO records) for all U.S.-flagged or U.S.-financed vessels that supplied enslaved labor or capital to Matanzas and Havana between 1820 and 1860. Cross-reference the shipowners and insurance underwriters with modern Wall Street banks. Generate an evidentiary matrix linking antebellum slave-trade profits directly to the modern blocked assets currently held by the U.S. Treasury.\"*\n\n**Example Command 3: The International Exequatur Map**\n> *\"Agent Omega: Query the PCA, IACHR, and HCCH databases for all binding international precedents where foreign domestic courts successfully attached U.S. commercial assets to satisfy human rights and expropriation judgments. Build a `Target Jurisdiction Matrix` identifying the top 20 foreign countries (in Europe, Latin America, and Asia) where U.S. corporate entities hold vulnerable, non-diplomatic commercial real estate and banking reserves that we can seize via dual-track exequatur.\"*\n\nBy deployin