\"No vector enters the master index without at least two corroborating sources\"\n    - \"No vector enters the master index without a complete citation chain\"\n    - \"No vector enters the master index without a SHA-256 hash\"\n    - \"Gaps in the chain must be flagged and assigned to Agent Omega for harvesting\"\n    - \"All mappings saved to .antigravity/knowledge/vector-index/\"\n```\n\n---\n\n## MISSING FILE 5: `.antigravity/skills/cryptographic-hashing.yaml`\n\n```yaml\nskill:\n  id: \"cryptographic-hashing\"\n  name: \"Cryptographic Hashing & Immutable Chain of Custody\"\n  version: \"1.0.0\"\n\n  capabilities:\n    - \"Generate SHA-256 hashes for every downloaded archival document\"\n    - \"Generate SHA-256 hashes for every generated legal document\"\n    - \"Maintain a Master_Chain_of_Custody_Log.md in 00_Master_Knowledge_Base/\"\n    - \"Timestamp every hash entry using ISO 8601 format\"\n    - \"Verify hash integrity before any document is cited in a filing\"\n    - \"Detect and flag any file modification after initial hashing\"\n    - \"Generate hash verification certificates for court submission\"\n\n  hashing_protocol:\n    algorithm: \"SHA-256\"\n    timestamp_format: \"ISO 8601 (YYYY-MM-DDTHH:MM:SSZ)\"\n    log_format: \"Markdown table with columns: Filename | SHA-256 Hash | Timestamp | Source | Agent ID\"\n    verification_trigger: \"Before every filing, before every Red Team audit, before every international submission\"\n    tamper_response: \"If hash mismatch detected, quarantine file, flag for Archival Sentinel re-retrieval, and log incident\"\n\n  output_requirements:\n    - \"Every file in 00_Master_Knowledge_Base/ must have a corresponding hash entry\"\n    - \"Every file in 02_Discovery_and_Evidentiary/ must have a corresponding hash entry\"\n    - \"Every generated pleading in 01_Pleadings_and_Complaints/ must have a corresponding hash entry\"\n    - \"Hash log must be append-only — no deletions permitted\"\n```\n\n---\n\n## MISSING FILE 6