t traps outlined in **Arcs 1 and 2 of the Centurion Entrapment Dossier**.\n\nTo execute this within your Google Antigravity PRO environment, issue the following **Directory-Level Execution Commands** to your agent swarms.\n\n***\n\n### EXECUTE DIRECTIVE ALPHA: THE VANGUARD BEACHHEAD (THE BAIT)\nWe will not file the Master Complaint yet. We will first file a highly targeted **Motion for Judicial Notice (Fed. R. Evid. 201)** and a companion **Rule 34 Request for Production** focused *exclusively* on the 1898–1902 Military Government land-title alterations and General Leonard Wood's dispatches. This appears to the DOJ as a narrow, easily dismissible historical inquiry. When they respond by claiming these matters are \"settled historical facts\" or invoke the \"political question\" doctrine, they will trigger our Judicial Estoppel and *Mitchell* Fiduciary Trust traps.\n\n> **COMMAND ALPHA: VANGUARD BEACHHEAD DEPLOYMENT & RULE 201 TRAP**\n> *\"Sun Tzu Strategist and Procedural Blacksmith: Access the `/04_Weaponized_Pleadings` directory. Isolate the `Motion_for_Judicial_Notice_Rule201.docx`. Strip this document down to a 'Vanguard Subset' focusing exclusively on NARA Record Group 140 (1898-1902 Land Title Auctions), NARA Record Group 94 (General Leonard Wood’s Dec. 6, 1900 dispatch to Sen. Orville Platt), and the Library of Congress Manuscript Division (Wood’s Oct. 29, 1901 dispatch to McKinley admitting the Platt Amendment extinguished Cuban independence to control the global sugar trade). Format this as an initial 'Petition for Archival Disclosure and Judicial Notice' to be filed in the D.C. Circuit. Embed the 'Standing Entrapment' and 'OFAC Continuous Tort Entrapment' arcs. Save as `Vanguard_Beachhead_Filing_01_FINAL.docx`. Prepare the accompanying `Sun_Tzu_Trap_Activation_Memo.md` detailing how the DOJ's anticipated Rule 12(b)(1) response will legally estop them from denying the Mitchell Fiduciary Trust exception.\"*\n\n### EXECUTE DIRECTIVE BETA: AGENT OMEGA'S CORPOR